HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The uuppggtt driver first appeared in OpenBSD 4.3.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     The uuppggtt driver was written by Marcus Glocker <_m_g_l_o_c_k_e_r_@_o_p_e_n_b_s_d_._o_r_g>.

CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     The uuppggtt driver just supports the USB 2.0 devices (GW3887 chipset) but
     not the USB 1.0 devices containing the NET2280, ISL3880, and ISL3886
     chipsets.  Some further efforts would be necessary to add USB 1.0 support
     to the driver.

